{
  "rc": {
    "_note": "多泳道 · 42(2026-10-11,§5.4):工程为池、会话为道,道的位置固定(池按最新变化排、池内按开始时刻);历史段按工具类目着色,尾巴(最后一个事件到现在线)只按状态画,右侧状态位 = 图标 + 这个状态从几点开始。放 4 道,不画子代理细分道与图例。\n段 / 尾巴 / 端帽由服务端摊平成平表(带道号),RCN 只有单层循环。",
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "title": "多泳道",
        "empty": "等待首次同步",
        "asof": "截至 ",
        "lang": "zh",
        "off": "还没打开实时会话",
        "offHint": "点这里，从手机上为电脑打开",
        "none": "没有在跑的会话",
        "moreL": "道"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "title": "Lanes",
        "empty": "Not synced yet",
        "asof": "As of ",
        "lang": "en",
        "off": "Live sessions are off",
        "offHint": "Tap to turn it on for your computer",
        "none": "No active sessions",
        "moreL": "more"
      }
    },
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#FDFBFA\\,#FBF3F1)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#1A1A1C\\,#221E1F)@90",
        "_note": "多泳道 · 42(2026-10-11,§5.4):工程为池、会话为道,道的位置固定(池按最新变化排、池内按开始时刻);历史段按工具类目着色,尾巴(最后一个事件到现在线)只按状态画,右侧状态位 = 图标 + 这个状态从几点开始。放 4 道,不画子代理细分道与图例。"
      },
      {
        "_note": "源色身份点:本包统一用 Claude 暖橙两档。",
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "14pt",
        "y": "{ttl.y}+({ttl.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "bgColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
      },
      {
        "id": "ttl",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "23pt",
        "y": "12pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-94pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "text": "${@i18n.title}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "typeface": "System-Bold"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(eq::(if::(eq::(if::(eq::(connect::(k,${w.devs}),k),0,1),1),if::(gt::(${w.devs},0),1,0),0),1),if::(eq::(${w.has},1),1,0),0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "type": "op",
            "action": "forEach",
            "props": {
              "items": "${w.lanes}",
              "key": "_it",
              "index": "_i"
            },
            "react": [
              {
                "type": "op",
                "action": "if",
                "props": {
                  "val": "$[if::(lt::(${_it.i},4),1,0)]"
                },
                "react": [
                  {
                    "type": "op",
                    "action": "if",
                    "props": {
                      "val": "$[if::(eq::(${_it.first},1),1,0)]"
                    },
                    "react": [
                      {
                        "type": "txt",
                        "x": "14pt",
                        "y": "34pt+${_it.i}*25pt+1pt",
                        "w": "56pt",
                        "h": "-1",
                        "text": "$[if::(eq::(${@i18n.lang},en),${_it.pe},${_it.pz})]",
                        "fontSize": "10pt",
                        "textColor": "$[if::(gt::(${_it.pw},0),#C98A00|#F5C242,#0E1116|#F3F4F6)]",
                        "maxLines": "1",
                        "typeface": "System-Bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "txt",
                    "x": "72pt",
                    "y": "34pt+${_it.i}*25pt+2pt",
                    "w": "24pt",
                    "h": "-1",
                    "text": "${_it.lab}",
                    "fontSize": "9pt",
                    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
                    "maxLines": "1",
                    "alpha": "$[if::(eq::(${_it.dim},1),0.5,1)]"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "layer",
                    "x": "98pt",
                    "y": "34pt+${_it.i}*25pt+2pt",
                    "w": "({parent.w}-166pt)",
                    "h": "10pt",
                    "bgColor": "#F1EEEC|#2A2725",
                    "cornerRadius": {
                      "leftT": "2pt",
                      "leftB": "2pt",
                      "rightT": "2pt",
                      "rightB": "2pt"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "op",
                    "action": "if",
                    "props": {
                      "val": "$[if::(eq::(${_it.st},running),1,0)]"
                    },
                    "react": [
                      {
                        "type": "path",
                        "x": "{parent.w}-62pt",
                        "y": "34pt+${_it.i}*25pt+2.5pt",
                        "w": "8pt",
                        "h": "9pt",
                        "d": "M0 0 L8 4.5 L0 9 Z",
                        "viewBox": "0 0 8 9",
                        "scaleType": "fitXY",
                        "fillColor": "#C15F3C|#E8916B"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "op",
                    "action": "if",
                    "props": {
